{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33760","headline":"正乐府十篇 惜义鸟 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 惜义鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商颜多义鸟，义鸟实可嗟。\n危巢末累累，隐在栲木花。\n他巢若有雏，乳之如一家。\n他巢若遭捕，投之同一罗。\n商人每秋贡，所贵复如何。\n饱以稻粱滋，饰以组绣华。\n惜哉仁义禽，委戏於宫娥。\n吾闻凤之贵，仁义亦足夸。\n所以不遭捕，盖缘生不多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}